{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel>\n    <data id=\"count\" expr=\"0\"/>\n    <data id=\"done\" expr=\"false\"/>\n    <data id=\"user\" expr=\"({name:'bob'})\"/>\n  </datamodel>\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <invoke type=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/\" src=\"child.scxml\"><finalize><raise event=\"x\"/></finalize></invoke>\n    <transition event=\"done.invoke\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml055-raise-in-finalize.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml055-raise-in-finalize.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":18,"byteOffset":329,"endColumn":94,"endLine":8,"startColumn":76,"startLine":8},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the `<raise>` element"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml055-raise-in-finalize.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":82,"endLine":8,"startColumn":77,"startLine":8}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<raise>` inside `<finalize>` raises an event, which `<finalize>` must not do\n\n**Note:** `<finalize>` runs while an event returned by the invoked service is being processed, before transitions are selected, to update the data model from `_event`; SCXML forbids it to raise events or invoke external actions, naming `<send>` and `<raise>` explicitly\n\n**Help:** keep only data-model updates (`<assign>`, `<log>`, `<if>`, `<foreach>`) in `<finalize>`; to react to the returned event, move the `<raise>` into a `<transition>` that matches it\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §6.5 <finalize>","text":"`<raise>` inside `<finalize>` raises an event, which `<finalize>` must not do"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":335,"start":330},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"inside this `<finalize>` of an `<invoke>`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml055-raise-in-finalize.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":75,"endLine":8,"startColumn":67,"startLine":8}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML055"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`<finalize>` runs while an event returned by an invoked service is processed, before transitions are selected, so the data model can be updated from `_event`; SCXML 1.0 §6.5 says its executable content MUST NOT raise events or invoke external actions, and that `<send>` and `<raise>` MUST NOT occur in it (at any depth, including `<if>` and `<foreach>` bodies)"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: keep only data-model updates in `<finalize>`, and move the `<raise>` or `<send>` into a `<transition>` that matches the returned event.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §6.5 <finalize>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML055` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#finalize","id":"SCXML055","name":"SCXML055","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a `<finalize>` raises or sends an event"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}